  "description": "<p>Rothco's Boot Laces are the ideal solution for anyone needing reliable, long-lasting replacement laces for their tactical boots. Designed for tactical, and law enforcement personnel, these laces are built to endure the toughest conditions. Made from durable polyamide (with black laces constructed from nylon), these boot laces are engineered to withstand heavy use. The heat-formed tips ensure that the laces will not fray, providing a secure fit and prolonged durability. Whether you're in the field or on duty, these boot laces will keep your boots securely fastened.</p>",
